{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026yMlcVieyoU1792749874.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>投資推廣署署長劉凱旋指，當局首9個月，已協助約550間海外和內地企業，來港開業或擴展業務。</p><p></p><p>投資推廣署署長劉凱旋表示︰「今年首九個月，我們協助約550間海外及內地企業，在香港設立業務並擴展規模。單是首年，我們已預計外來直接投資超過700億港元。企業落戶之後我們的支持並不止於此，我們與創辦人及管理團隊並肩合作，協助他們建立本地網絡、尋找合作夥伴，並為下一階段增長，包括國際擴張做好準備。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:04:44.721874+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":194,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T10:03:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T01:18:25.483795+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:18.000434+00:00","content_hash":"bd9816469d68dc9039980279017b44a05355a41e001edd101bf95a3396258c4c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:04:44.721874+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}